          %h2#references References
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                Wikipedia,
                %em
                  %a{:href => "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Covariant_derivative"} Covariant derivative
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Mikio+Nakahara"}> Mikio Nakahara
                , Section 10.4 of:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Geometry%2C+Topology+and+Physics"} Geometry, Topology and Physics
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1201/9781315275826"} doi:10.1201/9781315275826
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://alpha.sinp.msu.ru/~panov/LibBooks/GRAV/(Graduate_Student_Series_in_Physics)Mikio_Nakahara-Geometry,_Topology_and_Physics,_Second_Edition_(Graduate_Student_Series_in_Physics)-Institute_of_Physics_Publishing(2003).pdf"} pdf
          %p
            On covariant
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/differential+equations"} differential equations
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jan+Schouten"}> Jan Schouten
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em On the Conditions of Integrability of Covariant Differential Equations
              %strong 27
              4 (1925) 441-473 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.2307/1989236"}> doi:10.2307/1989236
              ,
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://www.jstor.org/stable/1989236"} jstor:1989236
          %p
            A discussion of covariant derivatives for a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Levi-Civita+connection"} Levi-Civita connection
            in terms of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/synthetic+differential+geometry"} synthetic differential geometry
            is in
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Gonzalo+Reyes"}> Gonzalo Reyes
              ,
              %em Covariant derivation
              (
              %a{:href => "https://marieetgonzalo.files.wordpress.com/2006/04/covariant-derivation1.pdf"}> pdf
              )
          %p
            On covariant
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Lie+derivatives"} Lie derivatives
            of
            = succeed "-valued" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/fiber+bundle"} bundle
            = succeed ":" do
